{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.ReidemeisterActionTable","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.ReidemeisterActionTable","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":24,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.far_comm_preserves_volume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.far_comm_preserves_volume","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L131-L132","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.r3_preserves_volume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.r3_preserves_volume","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L126-L129","doc":"R3 (Yang-Baxter) and far-commutativity preserve volume and trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.classical_hecke_involution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.classical_hecke_involution","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L115-L124","doc":"At q = 1, the Hecke relation degenerates to T² = 1 (involution),\nand all nuclear configurations at fixed A are degenerate.\n\nThe classical limit sets both the parameter and its inverse to `1`\n(`q⁻¹` is named explicitly since `R_q` has no `Inv` instance). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.reidemeister_action_table","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.reidemeister_action_table","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L84-L113","doc":"**Reidemeister action table** (Proposition):\n\nThe q-deformed R2 move is the ONLY Gröbner relation that\nchanges the gauge sector.  R3 and far-commutativity rearrange\ncrossings without energy cost.\n\nThe Hecke relation T² = (q - q⁻¹)T + 1 releases (q - q⁻¹)\nof Coulomb energy and 1 of volume binding per application.\n\nAll nuclear observables (mass, binding energy, Q-value,\nhalf-life) trace back to the single deformation parameter q\nthrough the R2 Hecke relation. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:reidemeister-action-table","label":"prop:reidemeister-action-table","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.preservesTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.preservesTrace","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L73-L82","doc":"Whether a braid move preserves the Markov trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.preservesVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.preservesVolume","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L62-L71","doc":"Whether a braid move preserves the hyperbolic volume (and hence mass). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.Skein_betaDecay","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.Skein_betaDecay","kind":"ctor","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.MarkovII","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.MarkovII","kind":"ctor","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.MarkovI","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.MarkovI","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.farCommutativity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.farCommutativity","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R3_YangBaxter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R3_YangBaxter","kind":"ctor","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R2_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R2_classical","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R2_qDeformed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R2_qDeformed","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R1_selfTwist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove.R1_selfTwist","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BraidMove","kind":"inductive","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L51-L60","doc":"Classification of braid moves by their effect on the action sectors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.total","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L47-L49","doc":"Total action is the sum of sectors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.matter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.matter","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.gauge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.gauge","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.gravity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.gravity","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.CategoricalAction","kind":"structure","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L41-L45","doc":"The three sectors of the categorical action on a nuclear link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.q_param","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/reidemeister-action-table.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.R_q","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/